<div style="font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#222;">
  <div style="background:#11998e;color:#fff;padding:24px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;text-align:center;">
    <h2 style="margin:0;">Profile submitted for review</h2>
  </div>
  <div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-top:0;padding:24px;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">
    <p>Hi <strong><%= @user.full_name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>
      <% if @kind == "new" %>
        Thank you for applying as an expert on Preview Tax. Your business profile was submitted on <%= @submitted_at %> and is now with our admin team for review.
      <% else %>
        Your updated expert profile was submitted on <%= @submitted_at %> and is back with our admin team for review.
      <% end %>
    </p>
    <p>We usually review profiles within 24-48 hours. You will receive an email and an in-app notification as soon as a decision is made.</p>
    <p>Questions? Write to <strong>support@previewtax.com</strong>.</p>
    <p>Regards,<br><strong>Preview Tax Team</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>
